WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:03.868
-Damning new details
have been revealed from

00:00:03.868 --> 00:00:06.334
the billion-dollar defamation
lawsuit against Fox News

00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:08.534
for spreading
the baseless conspiracy theory

00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:11.234
that the 2020 election
was rigged against Donald Trump,

00:00:11.234 --> 00:00:14.634
including an admission
from Fox boss Rupert Murdoch

00:00:14.634 --> 00:00:17.234
that the network's hosts
endorsed that lie

00:00:17.234 --> 00:00:19.567
despite knowing the truth.
And yet even now,

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:21.667
Fox's star anchors
are still repeating the lie

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:23.534
out of fear
of losing Trump's base.

00:00:23.534 --> 00:00:25.634
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:25.634 --> 00:00:27.634
[ Theme music plays ]

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:29.701
♪♪

00:00:29.701 --> 00:00:31.133
The conservative movement,

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:33.934
led by their chief propaganda
outlet, Fox News,

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:35.567
has a problem.
You see, they spent years

00:00:35.567 --> 00:00:37.634
laying the groundwork
for Donald Trump's rise.

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:38.934
Some of their
star personalities,

00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:40.634
like Sean Hannity
and Jeanine Pirro,

00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:44.467
even appeared onstage with Trump
at a campaign event.

00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:48.334
-The one thing that has made
and defined your presidency

00:00:48.334 --> 00:00:50.868
more than anything else --

00:00:50.868 --> 00:00:55.667
promises made, promises kept.

00:00:55.667 --> 00:01:00.701
-[ Loudly ] If you like the
America that he is making now,

00:01:00.701 --> 00:01:03.534
you've got to make sure
you get out there tomorrow

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:06.367
if you haven't voted yet.
Everyone you know --

00:01:06.367 --> 00:01:08.801
your grandmother, your cousin,
your kids.

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:11.434
Even your next-door neighbor,
if you don't like them,

00:01:11.434 --> 00:01:13.968
get them out to vote
for Donald Trump.

00:01:13.968 --> 00:01:16.567
-[ Loudly ] "I hate my neighbor,
and he hates me

00:01:16.567 --> 00:01:18.501
because he's always
calling the cops

00:01:18.501 --> 00:01:20.100
to file a noise complaint,

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:23.968
even though it's just me
talking quietly on the phone."

00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:25.734
[ Normal voice ] In fact,
that microphone --

00:01:25.734 --> 00:01:27.801
that microphone isn't even on.

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:31.100
Pirro's voice
just carries like that.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:32.868
If the microphone had been on,

00:01:32.868 --> 00:01:35.167
it would have flipped
all the breakers in the arena.

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:39.434
-[ Loudly ] If you like the
America that he is making now...

00:01:39.434 --> 00:01:42.801
[ Electricity powering down ]

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:44.868
-Although the grossest part
of that clip is

00:01:44.868 --> 00:01:46.801
when Trump first invites Hannity
up onstage,

00:01:46.801 --> 00:01:48.868
and Hannity uses
one of Trump's lines

00:01:48.868 --> 00:01:51.567
to insult the reporters
covering the rally, in the back,

00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:54.067
then smiles at Trump
like a little kiss-ass.

00:01:54.067 --> 00:01:56.901
-Sean Hannity, come on up.
Sean Hannity.

00:01:56.901 --> 00:01:58.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:58.334 --> 00:02:00.901
-By the way, all those people
in the back are fake news.

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:03.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:03.267 --> 00:02:04.367
[ Chuckles ]

00:02:04.367 --> 00:02:06.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.834 --> 00:02:08.100
-He smiles back at Trump

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.300
the way your two-year-old
smiles at you

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.434
when they first learn
to poop in the toilet.

00:02:12.434 --> 00:02:13.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.601 --> 00:02:16.234
"Look, Daddy,
I went potty all by myself."

00:02:16.234 --> 00:02:17.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.968 --> 00:02:20.267
"But don't get used to it."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.267 --> 00:02:24.067
You know, he's supposedly a host
on an alleged news network.

00:02:24.067 --> 00:02:26.234
And by the way, they didn't
have to call it Fox News.

00:02:26.234 --> 00:02:27.968
They could have called it
The Loud Guys Channel

00:02:27.968 --> 00:02:30.167
or, if they insist, FOX News,

00:02:30.167 --> 00:02:32.701
but spell "news"
with two O's and a Z

00:02:32.701 --> 00:02:35.133
so everyone would know
it's ironic.

00:02:35.133 --> 00:02:36.634
Point is, he works for Fox News.

00:02:36.634 --> 00:02:39.067
He's campaigning onstage
with a political candidate

00:02:39.067 --> 00:02:41.467
while calling the rest
of the media fake news.

00:02:41.467 --> 00:02:43.367
Look, I think my politics
are pretty clear,

00:02:43.367 --> 00:02:45.934
but I'd never appear at a rally
for a presidential candidate,

00:02:45.934 --> 00:02:47.567
mainly because
I would need cue cards,

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:50.100
and for some reason, Wally can't
get Secret Service clearance.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.234
-It's true, Seth.
I have a criminal record.

00:02:52.234 --> 00:02:55.334
-Wally, what crime
did you commit?

00:02:55.334 --> 00:02:56.968
-Oh, I commit a crime
every night, Seth.

00:02:56.968 --> 00:03:00.267
You see, whenever I'm in front
of an audience, I kill.

00:03:00.267 --> 00:03:02.000
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:06.834 --> 00:03:09.067
-Don't make a Hannity face!
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.067 --> 00:03:11.200
You're fake news!

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.734
Anyway, we now know from
a bombshell new court filing

00:03:13.734 --> 00:03:15.434
and a billion-dollar
defamation suit

00:03:15.434 --> 00:03:18.400
that Hannity,
along with other Fox hosts,

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.701
are the ones who knowingly lied
to their viewers.

00:03:20.701 --> 00:03:23.367
-A stunning, new court filing
revealing how top talent

00:03:23.367 --> 00:03:26.133
and executives at Fox News
trashed Donald Trump

00:03:26.133 --> 00:03:27.701
and ridiculed his legal team

00:03:27.701 --> 00:03:31.033
and their 2020 election
conspiracies behind the cameras,

00:03:31.033 --> 00:03:33.734
all while hyping those
same conspiracies on the air

00:03:33.734 --> 00:03:34.968
to their viewers.

00:03:34.968 --> 00:03:37.834
-As Trump lawyers, Rudy Giuliani
and Sidney Powell

00:03:37.834 --> 00:03:41.300
were making wildly false claims
about rigged voting machines

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:44.067
after Trump lost in 2020,

00:03:44.067 --> 00:03:47.400
private communications reveal
that pro-Trump voices

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:50.133
at Fox News
were calling it nuts.

00:03:50.133 --> 00:03:52.334
"That whole narrative
that Sidney was pushing,"

00:03:52.334 --> 00:03:54.100
said Fox's Sean Hannity,

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.334
"I did not believe it
for one second."

00:03:56.334 --> 00:03:58.234
-No, you didn't believe it
for one second.

00:03:58.234 --> 00:04:00.367
Well, then why did you
have her on your show?

00:04:00.367 --> 00:04:03.934
Were you doing a segment on how
leopard print is back in style?

00:04:03.934 --> 00:04:05.200
[ Laughter ]
Look at her.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.400
She looks like the
Tampa Bay Realtor of the Year.

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:09.767
But...
[ Laughter ]

00:04:09.767 --> 00:04:13.901
"Oh, yeah, on a tough year,
it should be noted."

00:04:13.901 --> 00:04:16.701
In fairness to Hannity,
maybe -- maybe he was just

00:04:16.701 --> 00:04:18.667
grilling Powell
on this narrative

00:04:18.667 --> 00:04:20.634
he says he didn't
believe for one second.

00:04:20.634 --> 00:04:22.701
-Let me ask you --
and I asked you about this

00:04:22.701 --> 00:04:24.300
on the radio show today --
I've gone over

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:25.801
everything
I've been able to find out.

00:04:25.801 --> 00:04:28.534
Nobody liked Dominion
Voting Systems -- nobody.

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:30.868
You said to me
that there were people

00:04:30.868 --> 00:04:35.033
watching an Internet connection
in real time,

00:04:35.033 --> 00:04:37.400
but they can't speak publicly
and haven't signed

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:40.868
affidavits to that.
Why?

00:04:40.868 --> 00:04:43.133
-Well, there are
a number of reasons.

00:04:43.133 --> 00:04:46.033
Some are within the government.

00:04:46.033 --> 00:04:48.067
We've got
evidence of corruption

00:04:48.067 --> 00:04:51.634
all across the country
in countless districts.

00:04:51.634 --> 00:04:55.400
The machine ran an algorithm
that shaved votes from Trump

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.300
and awarded them to Biden.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:05:01.133
They used the machines
to trash large batches of votes

00:05:01.133 --> 00:05:03.801
that should have been awarded
to President Trump.

00:05:03.801 --> 00:05:06.200
And they used a machine
to inject and add

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:09.400
massive quantities
of votes for Mr. Biden.

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:12.300
The only reason we really
found out about it --

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:15.033
-I thought Democrats told us
that we like whistleblowers.

00:05:15.033 --> 00:05:16.868
You're saying that
these people can't talk,

00:05:16.868 --> 00:05:19.100
'cause they're
gonna lose their job?

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:20.501
I would think that
they get protection.

00:05:20.501 --> 00:05:22.133
-They're gonna lose their job,

00:05:22.133 --> 00:05:23.968
their lives
have been threatened.

00:05:23.968 --> 00:05:26.467
One witness we know of
got beaten up

00:05:26.467 --> 00:05:28.601
and is in the hospital.
-"It's very sad.

00:05:28.601 --> 00:05:31.901
One witness we know of
got beaten up so bad,

00:05:31.901 --> 00:05:33.634
his head started to leak."

00:05:33.634 --> 00:05:35.267
[ Laughter ]

00:05:35.267 --> 00:05:36.534
So, Sean Hannity,

00:05:36.534 --> 00:05:39.133
the guy who's gleefully
stood onstage with Trump

00:05:39.133 --> 00:05:41.300
and called the reporters
in attendance "fake news,"

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:43.834
was on air endorsing
the views of a person

00:05:43.834 --> 00:05:46.567
he himself said he
did not believe for one second.

00:05:46.567 --> 00:05:47.901
And just to be clear,

00:05:47.901 --> 00:05:51.267
it's not just me saying
Hannity endorsed that lie.

00:05:51.267 --> 00:05:52.868
It's Hannity's boss,
Rupert Murdoch.

00:05:52.868 --> 00:05:55.567
A new court filing this week
features a partial transcript

00:05:55.567 --> 00:05:57.133
of a deposition with Murdoch,

00:05:57.133 --> 00:06:00.300
where he admits that Fox hosts
endorsed the bogus claim

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:02.033
that the 2020 election
was stolen.

00:06:02.033 --> 00:06:04.534
Here's part of that conversation
between Murdoch

00:06:04.534 --> 00:06:05.734
and the attorney
questioning him.

00:06:05.734 --> 00:06:07.734
Now, as I read this,
I just want you to know,

00:06:07.734 --> 00:06:10.000
I can't really do
a Rupert Murdoch impression.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.767
So instead,
I'm gonna read his answers

00:06:11.767 --> 00:06:14.868
in the most cartoonish
Australian accent I can manage.

00:06:14.868 --> 00:06:17.033
Here we go.
"You are aware now

00:06:17.033 --> 00:06:19.467
that Fox did more
than simply host these guests

00:06:19.467 --> 00:06:21.167
and give them
a platform, correct?"

00:06:21.167 --> 00:06:23.567
[ Australian accent ] "Yeah,
I think you've shown me

00:06:23.567 --> 00:06:26.868
some material
in support of that."

00:06:26.868 --> 00:06:28.734
[ Normal voice ] "In fact,
you are now aware

00:06:28.734 --> 00:06:30.067
that Fox endorsed at times

00:06:30.067 --> 00:06:31.834
this false notion
of a stolen election?"

00:06:31.834 --> 00:06:34.667
[ Australian accent ]
"Uh, not Fox, no.

00:06:34.667 --> 00:06:36.067
Uh, yeah, not Fox.

00:06:36.067 --> 00:06:38.033
But maybe, uh, Lou Dobbs,

00:06:38.033 --> 00:06:40.033
maybe, uh, Maria,

00:06:40.033 --> 00:06:43.033
as, uh, commentators."

00:06:43.033 --> 00:06:44.400
[ Normal voice ]
"We went through Fox hosts

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:45.567
Maria Bartiromo, yes?"

00:06:45.567 --> 00:06:46.601
[ Australian accent ]
"Yes. C'mon."

00:06:46.601 --> 00:06:47.767
[ Normal voice ]
"Fox host Jeanine Pirro?"

00:06:47.767 --> 00:06:49.200
[ Australian accent ]
"I think so."

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.367
[ Normal voice ] Fox Business
Host Lou Dobbs?"

00:06:50.367 --> 00:06:51.667
[ Australia accent ]
"Oh, yeah, Dobbsy,

00:06:51.667 --> 00:06:53.133
he did a bit, yeah."

00:06:53.133 --> 00:06:54.234
[ Normal voice ]
"Fox host Sean Hannity?"

00:06:54.234 --> 00:06:55.534
[ Australian accent ]
"Ah, the wombat.

00:06:55.534 --> 00:06:58.434
Yeah, a bit.
Sean 'The Wombat' Hannity."

00:06:58.434 --> 00:07:00.334
[ Normal voice ] "All were
in the document, correct?"

00:07:00.334 --> 00:07:01.667
[ Australian accent ]
"Yeah, they were."

00:07:01.667 --> 00:07:02.934
[ Normal voice ] "About
Fox endorsing the narrative

00:07:02.934 --> 00:07:04.100
of a stolen election, correct?"

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:06.033
[ Australian ] "No.
Some of our commentators,

00:07:06.033 --> 00:07:07.868
yeah, they were endorsing it."

00:07:07.868 --> 00:07:08.868
[ Normal voice ]
"About their endorsement

00:07:08.868 --> 00:07:09.968
of a stolen election?"

00:07:09.968 --> 00:07:11.767
[ Australian accent ] "Yeah.

00:07:11.767 --> 00:07:14.767
Yeah, they endorsed it."
[ Laughter ]

00:07:14.767 --> 00:07:16.400
[ Normal voice ]
Anyway, the point is,

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:18.634
Murdoch said, quote,
"they endorsed,"

00:07:18.634 --> 00:07:20.133
meaning Fox hosts
endorsed the lie

00:07:20.133 --> 00:07:22.133
that the election was stolen,
knowing it was a lie.

00:07:22.133 --> 00:07:24.334
In fact, that same court filing
also revealed

00:07:24.334 --> 00:07:26.734
that Hannity later
changed his tune on Trump

00:07:26.734 --> 00:07:28.367
after the January 6th
insurrection,

00:07:28.367 --> 00:07:30.567
although you'd never know it
from watching Hannity's show.

00:07:30.567 --> 00:07:32.367
Again, this is from
Sean Hannity's boss,

00:07:32.367 --> 00:07:33.601
Rupert Murdoch.

00:07:33.601 --> 00:07:35.033
According to court filing,
Paul Ryan,

00:07:35.033 --> 00:07:37.334
who is now a Fox board member,
had e-mailed Murdoch,

00:07:37.334 --> 00:07:39.834
"Ryan believed that 'some
high percentage of Americans'

00:07:39.834 --> 00:07:41.000
thought the election was stolen

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.701
'because they got
a diet of information

00:07:42.701 --> 00:07:44.400
telling them
the election was stolen

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.033
from what they believe
were credible sources.'

00:07:46.033 --> 00:07:47.334
Rupert responded
to Ryan's email,"

00:07:47.334 --> 00:07:49.567
saying, "'Thanks, Paul.
Wake-up call for Hannity,

00:07:49.567 --> 00:07:52.067
who has been privately
disgusted by Trump for weeks,

00:07:52.067 --> 00:07:53.801
but was scared to lose viewers."
Oh, my God.

00:07:53.801 --> 00:07:56.300
Sean Hannity
was disgusted by Trump?

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:57.868
What else was he doing
in private

00:07:57.868 --> 00:07:59.033
that he wasn't telling
his viewers about?

00:07:59.033 --> 00:08:00.968
Was he wearing
a "resist" T-shirt

00:08:00.968 --> 00:08:03.834
and playing with gender-neutral
potato-head gods?

00:08:03.834 --> 00:08:06.067
Oh, God, was he eating...

00:08:06.067 --> 00:08:07.934
[Echoing] woke M&amp;M's?

00:08:07.934 --> 00:08:09.400
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:10.834
[ Woman cackling ]

00:08:10.834 --> 00:08:12.467
-The milk chocolate
melts in your mouth,

00:08:12.467 --> 00:08:15.167
not in your
[Echoing] hand.

00:08:15.167 --> 00:08:17.667
[ Applause ]

00:08:17.667 --> 00:08:20.367
[ Laughter ]

00:08:20.367 --> 00:08:23.434
That's right.
Hannity was, according

00:08:23.434 --> 00:08:25.300
to Rupert Murdoch himself,
disgusted by Trump.

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:26.934
But Hannity
didn't tell his viewers that,

00:08:26.934 --> 00:08:28.100
just like he didn't tell
his viewers,

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:29.834
the stolen-election narrative
was B.S.

00:08:29.834 --> 00:08:31.801
Which brings us back
to the central problem

00:08:31.801 --> 00:08:34.534
the conservative movement
led by Fox is currently facing.

00:08:34.534 --> 00:08:36.300
They created this monster,
but they don't control it.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:38.067
They know that, and
that's why they're terrified.

00:08:38.067 --> 00:08:39.300
Right now,
they're desperately trying

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:40.701
to put the genie
back in the bottle.

00:08:40.701 --> 00:08:43.601
They're hyping Ron DeSantis
as an alternative to Trump,

00:08:43.601 --> 00:08:45.801
even though Trump
still leads in many polls.

00:08:45.801 --> 00:08:48.033
Just watch this clip
from "Fox &amp; Friends,

00:08:48.033 --> 00:08:50.167
earlier this week,
where host Brian Kilmeade

00:08:50.167 --> 00:08:52.033
scurries around
a Florida diner,

00:08:52.033 --> 00:08:54.200
just desperately searching
for someone, anyone,

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.767
who is willing to back
DeSantis over Trump.

00:08:56.767 --> 00:08:59.334
-First off, Metro Diner here,
I got a question for you.

00:08:59.334 --> 00:09:00.801
Ready?
-Yeah.

00:09:00.801 --> 00:09:05.067
Alright, 2024, who's
pumped up for the election?

00:09:05.067 --> 00:09:06.334
[ Cheers and applause ]
Alright.

00:09:06.334 --> 00:09:07.667
[ Smash Mouth's "All Star"
plays ]

00:09:07.667 --> 00:09:09.000
Rap-- Rapid-fire.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.734
Who's your man?
Who's your woman?

00:09:10.734 --> 00:09:13.400
-My man -- Donald Trump.
-Donald Trump.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:15.367
-Donald Trump. Christie, no.

00:09:15.367 --> 00:09:18.133
Christie, No.

00:09:18.133 --> 00:09:19.267
-Who's your man?
-Trump.

00:09:19.267 --> 00:09:21.334
-Or woman? Donald Trump.

00:09:21.334 --> 00:09:22.767
-I'd say Trump.

00:09:22.767 --> 00:09:24.634
-Trump. A lot of Trump fans.

00:09:24.634 --> 00:09:27.868
-Trump and Nikki Haley.
-And Nikki Haley.

00:09:27.868 --> 00:09:29.968
-Donald Trump and Nikki Haley.

00:09:29.968 --> 00:09:31.634
-Alright, so far,
a lot of Donald Trump.

00:09:31.634 --> 00:09:36.000
-I see -- I see
"Governor DeSantis."

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.234
And what about
President DeSantis?

00:09:38.234 --> 00:09:40.534
-I like it, I like it?
-Who's your pick?

00:09:40.534 --> 00:09:42.834
-Oh, gosh, I don't know.
Trump or DeSantis?

00:09:42.834 --> 00:09:45.367
I'm either/or.
-So you're right in the middle.

00:09:45.367 --> 00:09:46.734
-Yes, I am.
-But you're pumped up for it?

00:09:46.734 --> 00:09:48.367
-I am super pumped.
-Oh, my God.

00:09:48.367 --> 00:09:50.667
That was like watching
a gerbil trapped in a maze

00:09:50.667 --> 00:09:53.501
for a science experiment,
just locked in there,

00:09:53.501 --> 00:09:56.033
desperately searching
for a reward pellet.

00:09:56.033 --> 00:09:57.767
Also, it's fun
to watch Brian Kilmeade

00:09:57.767 --> 00:09:59.667
run around a diner
while Smash Mouth plays

00:09:59.667 --> 00:10:01.200
and, at the same time, think,

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.701
"He ain't the sharpest tool
in the shed."

00:10:02.701 --> 00:10:05.234
Also, I would just like
to point out

00:10:05.234 --> 00:10:06.868
that according
to the clock on-screen,

00:10:06.868 --> 00:10:08.868
it is just past 6:30 a.m.,

00:10:08.868 --> 00:10:11.601
and they are blasting
the "Shrek" soundtrack.

00:10:11.601 --> 00:10:14.300
Obviously, a pretty
conservative place.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:16.100
But based on the fact
it's the crack of dawn

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:18.200
and your diner is a
standing-room-only dance party,

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:21.868
seems like Biden's America is
going pretty well for you guys.

00:10:21.868 --> 00:10:24.267
You all got egg money.
[ Laughter ]

00:10:24.267 --> 00:10:26.767
Now, before you make the shape
of an "L" on your forehead

00:10:26.767 --> 00:10:28.167
in regard
to Kilmeade's inability

00:10:28.167 --> 00:10:30.400
to find a DeSantis reporter,
even I feel bad

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:33.434
when he finally sees someone
wearing a DeSantis T-shirt,

00:10:33.434 --> 00:10:35.934
races across the room
to talk to her,

00:10:35.934 --> 00:10:39.234
and even she says she's torn
between DeSantis and Trump.

00:10:39.234 --> 00:10:40.901
Come on, lady,
that's almost as bad

00:10:40.901 --> 00:10:42.133
as wearing a shirt that says,

00:10:42.133 --> 00:10:44.100
"Ask me about how
I'm voting for DeSantis!"

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:45.634
Are you voting for DeSantis?

00:10:45.634 --> 00:10:48.868
"Um, maybe."
[ Laughter ]

00:10:48.868 --> 00:10:50.901
"I just wanted to be asked."

00:10:50.901 --> 00:10:52.501
[ Laughter ]

00:10:52.501 --> 00:10:54.267
Kilmeade ran to her
like he saw a tunnel

00:10:54.267 --> 00:10:56.033
painted on the side
of the mountain

00:10:56.033 --> 00:10:58.267
and thought, "I'm gonna
catch that roadrunner."

00:10:58.267 --> 00:11:00.100
[ Laughter ]
But that clip

00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:02.267
perfectly encapsulates
the problem for Fox News.

00:11:02.267 --> 00:11:05.200
No matter how hard
they try to wriggle their way

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:07.133
out of the situation
they put themselves in,

00:11:07.133 --> 00:11:09.901
they are captive
to the audience they created.

00:11:09.901 --> 00:11:11.934
That's why Fox is terrified
of losing viewers

00:11:11.934 --> 00:11:13.367
in the aftermath
of the election,

00:11:13.367 --> 00:11:15.234
and that's why
they were willing to do or say

00:11:15.234 --> 00:11:17.167
whatever was necessary
to avoid losing them,

00:11:17.167 --> 00:11:19.834
even if that meant
repeating outright lies

00:11:19.834 --> 00:11:21.834
that they knew
were outright lies.

00:11:21.834 --> 00:11:24.767
Fox host Tucker Carlson was
apparently so terrified of Trump

00:11:24.767 --> 00:11:26.300
that, according
to the court filing,

00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:27.767
he wrote in one text message

00:11:27.767 --> 00:11:30.734
that Trump is "a demonic force,
a destroyer.

00:11:30.734 --> 00:11:32.567
But he's not going to
destroy us."

00:11:32.567 --> 00:11:35.601
I don't even think I've ever
called Trump a demonic force.

00:11:35.601 --> 00:11:38.100
That's worse than anything
I've ever said about Trump,

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:40.434
including the time I called
Trump a [Prolonged bleep].

00:11:40.434 --> 00:11:43.434
[ Laughter ]

00:11:43.434 --> 00:11:45.968
[ Bleep continues ]

00:11:45.968 --> 00:11:49.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:51.834 --> 00:11:53.434
Ohhh, we got -- we got some --

00:11:53.434 --> 00:11:55.067
I've got some lip-readers.

00:11:55.067 --> 00:11:58.567
[ Laughter ]

00:11:58.567 --> 00:12:01.234
Tucker was apparently so
terrified of this demonic force

00:12:01.234 --> 00:12:03.234
that when a Fox News reporter
fact-checked

00:12:03.234 --> 00:12:05.767
Trump's unhinged claims
about Dominion on Twitter,

00:12:05.767 --> 00:12:07.334
Tucker wanted her punished.

00:12:07.334 --> 00:12:09.634
-When Trump falsely claimed
that Dominion Machines

00:12:09.634 --> 00:12:12.200
cost him 2.7 million votes,

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:15.334
Fox reporter Jacqui Heinrich
responded with a tweet,

00:12:15.334 --> 00:12:17.767
saying, "Dominion Voting
and top election

00:12:17.767 --> 00:12:20.968
infrastructure officials
categorically deny this."

00:12:20.968 --> 00:12:22.934
Some of Heinrich's
colleagues at Fox

00:12:22.934 --> 00:12:25.534
wanted her to be punished,
even though they knew

00:12:25.534 --> 00:12:27.467
that what she was saying
was true.

00:12:27.467 --> 00:12:30.167
"Please get her fired.
Seriously,"

00:12:30.167 --> 00:12:33.701
Tucker Carlson wrote hosts
Laura Ingraham and Sean Hannity.

00:12:33.701 --> 00:12:36.434
"It needs to stop immediately,
like tonight.

00:12:36.434 --> 00:12:38.667
It's measurably
hurting the company.

00:12:38.667 --> 00:12:41.434
The stock price down.
Not a joke."

00:12:41.434 --> 00:12:43.601
-Ugh. Cancel culture.
Am I right?

00:12:43.601 --> 00:12:44.801
But there you go.

00:12:44.801 --> 00:12:46.868
Faux-populist scourge
of the establishment

00:12:46.868 --> 00:12:49.367
Tucker Carlson was worried
about the company's stock price.

00:12:49.367 --> 00:12:50.734
You know what that means?
That means,

00:12:50.734 --> 00:12:52.434
on top of everything else,
on top of being a liar,

00:12:52.434 --> 00:12:54.834
racist, conspiracy theorist,
he's also one of those guys

00:12:54.834 --> 00:12:57.000
who actually uses the stock app.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:59.267
I mean, what kind of monster?

00:12:59.267 --> 00:13:02.067
Isn't that the first thing we
all do when we get a new phone?

00:13:02.067 --> 00:13:04.701
You either delete the stocks app
or you moving into a folder

00:13:04.701 --> 00:13:06.801
called Apps Only Psychos Use,

00:13:06.801 --> 00:13:09.834
along with
Apple Maps and Compass.

00:13:09.834 --> 00:13:12.601
Also, you guys,
why is there a Compass app?

00:13:12.601 --> 00:13:17.234
Is a large percentage of
Apple's customer base sailors?

00:13:17.234 --> 00:13:20.033
"Arrrghh!
I think we're lost.

00:13:20.033 --> 00:13:23.234
You find the North Star,
and I'll open the Sextant app."

00:13:23.234 --> 00:13:25.868
[ Laughter ]
"Ah, avast, ye mateys,

00:13:25.868 --> 00:13:28.667
anyone got a charger?"
[ Laughter ]

00:13:28.667 --> 00:13:32.167
"Always down to 2%."
[ Laughter ]

00:13:32.167 --> 00:13:35.067
"Blackbeard, use your head!"
[ Laughter ]

00:13:35.067 --> 00:13:36.734
I'll tell you this much.

00:13:36.734 --> 00:13:38.000
If things ever go badly enough

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:41.200
that, "Yeah, we're still
on Compass bits,"

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:44.868
we'll get back to the news
with a bone to pick, right?

00:13:44.868 --> 00:13:47.133
Every now and then,
you know, a door opens

00:13:47.133 --> 00:13:48.868
and you get a chance
to unload a lot of thoughts

00:13:48.868 --> 00:13:50.901
you've had
about the Compass app.

00:13:50.901 --> 00:13:52.968
"Sure, I can move
back on to Fox News.

00:13:52.968 --> 00:13:55.467
We talk about them all the time.
This is my one chance.

00:13:55.467 --> 00:13:58.767
And look, I can tell
I don't need an app

00:13:58.767 --> 00:14:01.033
to tell
you're not fully with me.

00:14:01.033 --> 00:14:04.100
[ Laughter ]

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:06.100
[ Chuckles ]

00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:09.033
I'll tell you this much.
If things ever go badly enough

00:14:09.033 --> 00:14:10.467
that I need to use
my Compass app,

00:14:10.467 --> 00:14:13.934
start writing my eulogy.
If my phone knows me at all,

00:14:13.934 --> 00:14:16.133
I'll click that thing open,
instead of north or south,

00:14:16.133 --> 00:14:18.400
it'll just say, "You're gonna
die in these woods."

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.501
[ Laughter ]
See?

00:14:20.501 --> 00:14:23.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:14:23.901 --> 00:14:27.200
Also, let me just say,
by way of comparison,

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:29.300
as far as I can recall,
I have never once

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.901
looked at Comcast's stock price,

00:14:30.901 --> 00:14:32.934
mostly because
I'm super worried it went down

00:14:32.934 --> 00:14:35.567
when I was doing
my Australian accent.

00:14:35.567 --> 00:14:36.901
I don't want to get a call

00:14:36.901 --> 00:14:38.601
from the head of
International Business Affairs

00:14:38.601 --> 00:14:40.234
telling me, [Australian accent]
"Oi, mate, give it a rest.

00:14:40.234 --> 00:14:43.033
Crikey."
[ Laughter ]

00:14:43.033 --> 00:14:45.367
[ Normal voice ]
Yet, two years later,

00:14:45.367 --> 00:14:47.601
Fox is still scared of losing
that Trump base.

00:14:47.601 --> 00:14:49.434
And so. two years later,
they're still repeating

00:14:49.434 --> 00:14:51.133
those same lies
about the 2020 election.

00:14:51.133 --> 00:14:52.534
Now they just do it

00:14:52.534 --> 00:14:55.033
in their thinly veiled,
"Just Asking Questions" style.

00:14:55.033 --> 00:14:57.200
Here's Tucker doing that
just last month.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:59.234
-There are so many
unanswered questions,

00:14:59.234 --> 00:15:00.701
some of them lingering.

00:15:00.701 --> 00:15:04.000
How, for example,
did senile hermit Joe Biden

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:07.667
get 15 million more votes
than his former boss,

00:15:07.667 --> 00:15:11.100
rock-star crowd-surfer
Barack Obama?

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:12.834
Results like that
would seem to defy

00:15:12.834 --> 00:15:16.067
the laws of known physics and
qualify, instead, as a miracle.

00:15:16.067 --> 00:15:18.501
Was the 2020 election a miracle?

00:15:18.501 --> 00:15:20.667
-"Was the 2020 election
a miracle?

00:15:20.667 --> 00:15:24.267
Did God himself intervene
and make Joe Biden president?

00:15:24.267 --> 00:15:26.000
And if so, how did he do it?

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:29.000
Did he go to a polling place
15 million times

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:31.734
in different disguises
to vote for Joe Biden?

00:15:31.734 --> 00:15:33.767
Did he go one time
disguised as a chef?

00:15:33.767 --> 00:15:36.167
Did he go a second time
disguised as a pilot?

00:15:36.167 --> 00:15:38.667
Did he go a third,
a fourth, and a fifth time

00:15:38.667 --> 00:15:41.300
wearing all the various costumes
from the Village People?

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:44.767
And if God did do that,
it would raise the question,

00:15:44.767 --> 00:15:48.834
'What if God was one of us,
just a slob like one of us,

00:15:48.834 --> 00:15:50.834
just a stranger on the bus?'

00:15:50.834 --> 00:15:53.100
Was he trying to make
his way home?

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:55.067
And if he was trying
to make his way home,

00:15:55.067 --> 00:15:56.400
how did he find it?

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:58.434
Does he use the Compass app?"

00:15:58.434 --> 00:16:00.501
[ Laughter,
cheers and applause ]

00:16:00.501 --> 00:16:03.667
We stuck it out. It paid off.

00:16:03.667 --> 00:16:05.601
"And if all of that is true,

00:16:05.601 --> 00:16:08.033
does that mean
God committed voter fraud?

00:16:08.033 --> 00:16:10.734
And if God
committed voter fraud,

00:16:10.734 --> 00:16:12.501
does that mean he's..."
-Fake news.

00:16:12.501 --> 00:16:14.467
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:16:14.467 --> 00:16:16.767
[ Theme music plays ]

00:16:16.767 --> 00:16:17.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

